gcXT(){return"How to complete the Tax System setup?"},
gcXS(){return"This guide walks through the entire integration flow with the Iranian Taxpayers System in the new Hesabix version\u2014from key generation to data quality checks and invoice submission."},
gcXX(){return"Prerequisites before you begin"},
gcXU(){return"Access to the \u201cTax System\u201d menu as a business admin"},
